# Git Commit Language

- Write all git commit messages in English.
- Prefer concise, imperative mood (e.g. "Add feature", "Fix bug", "Update docs").
- Focus the message on why the change was made when helpful; keep it to 1–2 short sentences.

```text
# ❌ BAD
添加登录功能
修复空指针问题

# ✅ GOOD
Add user login flow
Fix null pointer when parsing empty response
```
